    "calendar_agent": {
      "description": "Calendar and contacts specialist for CalDAV/CardDAV providers. Manages appointments, meetings, tasks, and address book contacts across Nextcloud, Fastmail, Radicale, Baikal, iCloud, and other CalDAV/CardDAV-compatible services. Example queries: 'what meetings do I have next week?', 'welche Termine stehen diese Woche an?', 'schedule a 30-minute call with Anna on Thursday', 'lege einen Termin für Freitag 14 Uhr an', 'find contact details for Müller GmbH', 'Kontaktdaten im Adressbuch suchen', 'reschedule tomorrow's 10am to 2pm', 'Termin verschieben und alle Teilnehmer informieren'.",
